manage issue

Usage:
  mdql issue [command]

Available Commands:
  add         create issue
  archive     archive issue
  list        list issue
  show        show issue
  update      update issue

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for issue

Global Flags:
  -f, --format string   output: table|json|csv|tsv
  -q, --quiet           IDs only
      --root string     store root (default ".")
      --schema string   schema file path (default "./schema.yml")

Use "mdql issue [command] --help" for more information about a command.
